WEBVTT

00:00:58.247 --> 00:01:00.819
because when it comes
to creativity and to leadership,

00:01:00.843 --> 00:01:03.040
we need introverts
doing what they do best.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.338
CA: Speaking as something
of an introvert myself,

00:01:06.362 --> 00:01:08.863
I find this whole topic super interesting.

00:01:08.887 --> 00:01:12.630
Really, talking with Susan
is kind of like coming home,

00:01:12.654 --> 00:01:17.106
and in the next hour, we'll be discussing
how to better manage our places of work,

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:20.255
our schools, our relationships,

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:25.391
and explore what the scientific
understanding of introversion really is.

00:01:29.685 --> 00:01:31.789
Susan Cain, welcome.